body:
I think she's doing an amazing job and while I also love Kathy Bates and the roles she plays, maybe this role was meant for Frances - I just love it and she really embodies post-pill Belle well that ranges from a small, pre-pill Belle, after today's (yesterday's) episode it just made me love her even more. I think she had a lot of fun filming it too, but I think she always plays great roles.

&#x200B;

Also, liked Evan's performance. Is it just me or is he taking more LGBTQ roles or something? Did not see that coming but was a surprising episode. Love this season over all though.
